# Additional Notification Recipients (comma-separated)
# These emails will receive notifications for ALL video processing completions
NOTIFICATION_EMAILS=admin@yourcompany.com,notifications@yourcompany.com

# Brevo Setup Instructions:
# 1. Sign up for a free Brevo account: https://www.brevo.com/
# 2. Go to Settings > API Keys: https://app.brevo.com/settings/keys/api
# 3. Create a new API key with "Send emails" permission
# 4. Copy the API key and set it as BREVO_API_KEY
# 5. Verify your sender email domain in Brevo dashboard

# Benefits of Brevo API over SMTP:
# - More reliable delivery
# - Better deliverability rates
# - No SMTP configuration needed
# - Built-in analytics and tracking
# - Free tier: 300 emails/day
# - Automatic retry on failures

# Alternative: If you prefer SMTP, you can modify the email service
# to use traditional SMTP instead of Brevo API
